<title>USA: Finish Line stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Finish Line stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Boston investor Jeffrey Vinik said Monday it holds an 8.3 percent stake in Finish Line, or 1,408,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between December 3, 1996, and February 20, 1997, at prices ranging from $18.75 to $25.50 per share. The stake is held for investment purposes.</p>
<p>Finish Line, based in Indianapolis, Ind., is a retailer of athletic footwear and clothing.</p>
